99:The last round already? Time sure flies! Looks like this will be over soon.
100:Incredible... She's won almost every hand since the match started...
101:That bad rabbit is cheating! I'm sure of it, nyaa! She never wins this much when she plays with me, nyaa!
102:Ohoho! Jealous of my lucky streak, shorty? What a pity, seems you'll never retake Mahjong Soul Shrine at this rate.
103:What do we do...? Kirito's already low on points. If this keeps up...
