105:(Stay calm and think... There's definitely something amiss here... What's the difference between the hands she wins and the ones she doesn't...?)
106:(I suspect Kaguyahime is relying on some sort of trick that lets her see through the tiles. How else could she keep building such insanely good hands?)
107:(In that case... our only chance of winning is to somehow stop her from drawing tiles!)
108:Okay... After feeling out the last few rounds, it's pretty clear we can't win like this.
111:...Got it!
113:...I trust you!
